{
  "book": "3nephi",
  "bookName": "3 Nephi",
  "chapter": 11,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 522.331,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 6.502,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now it came to pass that there were a great multitude gathered together, of the people of Nephi,",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 6.682,
      "end": 10.444,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "round about the temple which was in the land Bountiful;",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 10.624,
      "end": 12.064,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they were marveling",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 12.244,
      "end": 14.473,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and wondering one with another,",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 14.653,
      "end": 19.669,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and were showing one to another the great and marvelous change which had taken place.",
      "verse": "11:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 20.349,
      "end": 23.925,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they were also conversing about this Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.105,
      "end": 27.031,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of whom the sign had been given concerning his death.",
      "verse": "11:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 27.711,
      "end": 34.491,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that while they were thus conversing one with another, they heard a voice as if it came out of heaven;",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 34.671,
      "end": 36.947,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they cast their eyes round about,",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 37.127,
      "end": 40.331,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they understood not the voice which they heard;",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 40.511,
      "end": 42.554,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it was not a harsh voice,",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 42.734,
      "end": 44.684,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither was it a loud voice;",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 44.864,
      "end": 48.301,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, and notwithstanding it being a small voice",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 48.481,
      "end": 51.267,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "it did pierce them that did hear to the center,",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 51.447,
      "end": 56.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "insomuch that there was no part of their frame that it did not cause to quake;",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 56.968,
      "end": 58.593,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, it did pierce them",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 58.773,
      "end": 62.21,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to the very soul, and did cause their hearts to burn.",
      "verse": "11:3",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 62.89,
      "end": 66.466,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that again they heard the voice,",
      "verse": "11:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 66.646,
      "end": 68.132,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they understood it not.",
      "verse": "11:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 68.812,
      "end": 72.388,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again the third time they did hear the voice,",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 72.568,
      "end": 75.122,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did open their ears to hear it;",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 75.302,
      "end": 78.321,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their eyes were towards the sound thereof;",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 78.501,
      "end": 81.659,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they did look steadfastly towards heaven,",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 81.839,
      "end": 83.557,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "from whence the sound came.",
      "verse": "11:5",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 84.237,
      "end": 88.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, the third time they did understand the voice which they heard;",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 88.875,
      "end": 90.5,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it said unto them:",
      "verse": "11:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 91.18,
      "end": 94.245,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold my Beloved Son, in whom I am well pleased,",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 94.425,
      "end": 96.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in whom I have glorified my name\u2014",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 96.648,
      "end": 97.763,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "hear ye him.",
      "verse": "11:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 98.443,
      "end": 101.137,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass, as they understood",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 101.317,
      "end": 104.15,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they cast their eyes up again towards heaven;",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 104.33,
      "end": 107.674,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, they saw a Man descending out of heaven;",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 107.854,
      "end": 110.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he was clothed in a white robe;",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 110.356,
      "end": 113.235,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he came down and stood in the midst of them;",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 113.415,
      "end": 116.666,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the eyes of the whole multitude were turned upon him,",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 116.846,
      "end": 118.982,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they durst not open their mouths,",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 119.162,
      "end": 120.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even one to another,",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 120.967,
      "end": 122.592,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and wist not what it meant,",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 122.772,
      "end": 126.255,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they thought it was an angel that had appeared unto them.",
      "verse": "11:8",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 126.935,
      "end": 130.139,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he stretched forth his hand",
      "verse": "11:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 130.319,
      "end": 132.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and spake unto the people, saying:",
      "verse": "11:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 133.228,
      "end": 134.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I am Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "11:10",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 135.126,
      "end": 138.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom the prophets testified shall come into the world.",
      "verse": "11:10",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 139.057,
      "end": 143.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I am the light and the life of the world;",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 143.184,
      "end": 147.456,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I have drunk out of that bitter cup which the Father hath given me,",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 147.636,
      "end": 151.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have glorified the Father in taking upon me the sins of the world,",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 151.903,
      "end": 156.872,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the which I have suffered the will of the Father in all things from the beginning.",
      "verse": "11:11",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 157.552,
      "end": 160.989,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when Jesus had spoken these words",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 161.169,
      "end": 163.723,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the whole multitude fell to the earth;",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 163.903,
      "end": 167.618,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for they remembered that it had been prophesied among them",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 167.798,
      "end": 172.999,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that Christ should show himself unto them after his ascension into heaven.",
      "verse": "11:12",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 173.679,
      "end": 176.976,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Lord spake unto them saying:",
      "verse": "11:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 177.656,
      "end": 179.885,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Arise and come forth unto me,",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 180.065,
      "end": 182.805,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may thrust your hands into my side,",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 182.985,
      "end": 187.861,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also that ye may feel the prints of the nails in my hands and in my feet,",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 188.041,
      "end": 190.874,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may know that I am the God of Israel,",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 191.054,
      "end": 193.004,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the God of the whole earth,",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 193.184,
      "end": 196.017,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and have been slain for the sins of the world.",
      "verse": "11:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 196.697,
      "end": 199.994,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the multitude went forth,",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 200.174,
      "end": 202.589,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thrust their hands into his side,",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 202.769,
      "end": 207.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did feel the prints of the nails in his hands and in his feet;",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 207.268,
      "end": 210.24,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this they did do, going forth one by one",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 210.42,
      "end": 212.324,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "until they had all gone forth,",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 212.504,
      "end": 214.687,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did see with their eyes",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 214.867,
      "end": 217.375,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did feel with their hands,",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 217.555,
      "end": 219.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did know of a surety",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 219.778,
      "end": 222.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did bear record, that it was he,",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 222.791,
      "end": 226.042,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of whom it was written by the prophets, that should come.",
      "verse": "11:15",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 226.722,
      "end": 229.973,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when they had all gone forth and had witnessed for themselves,",
      "verse": "11:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 230.153,
      "end": 232.568,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "they did cry out with one accord, saying:",
      "verse": "11:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 233.248,
      "end": 236.359,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Hosanna! Blessed be the name of the Most High God!",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 236.539,
      "end": 239.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they did fall down at the feet of Jesus,",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 239.691,
      "end": 241.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did worship him.",
      "verse": "11:17",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 241.904,
      "end": 244.783,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he spake unto Nephi",
      "verse": "11:18",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 244.963,
      "end": 247.517,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(for Nephi was among the multitude)",
      "verse": "11:18",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 247.697,
      "end": 250.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he commanded him that he should come forth.",
      "verse": "11:18",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 250.838,
      "end": 252.417,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And Nephi arose",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 252.597,
      "end": 253.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went forth,",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 254.031,
      "end": 256.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bowed himself before the Lord",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 256.719,
      "end": 258.391,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and did kiss his feet.",
      "verse": "11:19",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 259.071,
      "end": 261.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord commanded him that he should arise.",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 261.945,
      "end": 264.36,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he arose and stood before him.",
      "verse": "11:20",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 265.04,
      "end": 266.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And the Lord said unto him:",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 267.124,
      "end": 270.746,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I give unto you power that ye shall baptize this people",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 270.926,
      "end": 273.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when I am again ascended into heaven.",
      "verse": "11:21",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 274.16,
      "end": 276.25,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again the Lord called others,",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 276.43,
      "end": 278.52,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and said unto them likewise;",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 278.7,
      "end": 281.254,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he gave unto them power to baptize.",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 281.434,
      "end": 282.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he said unto them:",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 283.147,
      "end": 285.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "On this wise shall ye baptize;",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 285.603,
      "end": 288.389,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and there shall be no disputations among you.",
      "verse": "11:22",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 289.069,
      "end": 290.834,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Verily I say unto you,",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 291.014,
      "end": 294.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that whoso repenteth of his sins through your words,",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 294.677,
      "end": 297.138,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and desireth to be baptized in my name,",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 297.318,
      "end": 299.547,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "on this wise shall ye baptize them\u2014",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 299.727,
      "end": 302.792,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, ye shall go down and stand in the water,",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 302.972,
      "end": 305.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in my name shall ye baptize them.",
      "verse": "11:23",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 306.16,
      "end": 311.315,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now behold, these are the words which ye shall say, calling them by name, saying:",
      "verse": "11:24",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 311.995,
      "end": 314.689,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Having authority given me of Jesus Christ,",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 314.869,
      "end": 317.33,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I baptize you in the name of the Father",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 317.51,
      "end": 319.739,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and of the Son, and of the Holy Ghost.",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 319.919,
      "end": 320.755,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "11:25",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 321.435,
      "end": 323.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And then shall ye immerse them in the water,",
      "verse": "11:26",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 324.123,
      "end": 326.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and come forth again out of the water.",
      "verse": "11:26",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 327.264,
      "end": 330.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after this manner shall ye baptize in my name;",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 330.602,
      "end": 332.924,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, verily I say unto you,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 333.104,
      "end": 334.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Father,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 334.677,
      "end": 335.977,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Son,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 336.157,
      "end": 338.293,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Holy Ghost are one;",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 338.473,
      "end": 341.677,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I am in the Father, and the Father in me,",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 341.857,
      "end": 343.807,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Father and I are one.",
      "verse": "11:27",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 344.487,
      "end": 348.016,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And according as I have commanded you thus shall ye baptize.",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 348.196,
      "end": 353.49,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And there shall be no disputations among you, as there have hitherto been;",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 353.67,
      "end": 357.107,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither shall there be disputations among you",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 357.287,
      "end": 361.095,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "concerning the points of my doctrine, as there have hitherto been.",
      "verse": "11:28",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 361.775,
      "end": 364.19,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For verily, verily I say unto you,",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 364.37,
      "end": 367.946,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he that hath the spirit of contention is not of me,",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 368.126,
      "end": 371.516,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but is of the devil, who is the father of contention,",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 371.696,
      "end": 376.758,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he stirreth up the hearts of men to contend with anger, one with another.",
      "verse": "11:29",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 377.438,
      "end": 384.358,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, this is not my doctrine, to stir up the hearts of men with anger, one against another;",
      "verse": "11:30",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 384.538,
      "end": 388.718,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but this is my doctrine, that such things should be done away.",
      "verse": "11:30",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 389.398,
      "end": 391.766,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, verily, verily, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "11:31",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 391.946,
      "end": 394.268,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I will declare unto you my doctrine.",
      "verse": "11:31",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 394.948,
      "end": 396.62,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And this is my doctrine,",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 396.8,
      "end": 400.422,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and it is the doctrine which the Father hath given unto me;",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 400.602,
      "end": 403.435,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I bear record of the Father,",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 403.615,
      "end": 406.123,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Father beareth record of me,",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 406.303,
      "end": 410.111,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Holy Ghost beareth record of the Father and me;",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 410.291,
      "end": 416.793,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I bear record that the Father commandeth all men, everywhere, to repent and believe in me.",
      "verse": "11:32",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 417.473,
      "end": 419.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whoso believeth in me,",
      "verse": "11:33",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 419.557,
      "end": 422.251,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and is baptized, the same shall be saved;",
      "verse": "11:33",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 422.431,
      "end": 425.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they are they who shall inherit the kingdom of God.",
      "verse": "11:33",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 426.222,
      "end": 428.265,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whoso believeth not in me,",
      "verse": "11:34",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 428.445,
      "end": 430.628,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and is not baptized, shall be damned.",
      "verse": "11:34",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 431.308,
      "end": 433.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 433.81,
      "end": 435.482,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that this is my doctrine,",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 435.662,
      "end": 438.263,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I bear record of it from the Father;",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 438.443,
      "end": 441.972,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whoso believeth in me believeth in the Father also;",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 442.152,
      "end": 445.078,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and unto him will the Father bear record of me,",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 445.258,
      "end": 448.555,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he will visit him with fire and with the Holy Ghost.",
      "verse": "11:35",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 449.235,
      "end": 451.929,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus will the Father bear record of me,",
      "verse": "11:36",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 452.109,
      "end": 456.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Holy Ghost will bear record unto him of the Father and me;",
      "verse": "11:36",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 456.654,
      "end": 459.812,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Father, and I, and the Holy Ghost are one.",
      "verse": "11:36",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 460.492,
      "end": 462.21,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again I say unto you,",
      "verse": "11:37",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 462.39,
      "end": 463.876,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye must repent,",
      "verse": "11:37",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 464.056,
      "end": 466.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and become as a little child,",
      "verse": "11:37",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 466.372,
      "end": 468.183,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be baptized in my name,",
      "verse": "11:37",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 468.363,
      "end": 470.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or ye can in nowise receive these things.",
      "verse": "11:37",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 471.644,
      "end": 473.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And again I say unto you,",
      "verse": "11:38",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 473.542,
      "end": 475.028,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye must repent,",
      "verse": "11:38",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 475.208,
      "end": 477.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be baptized in my name,",
      "verse": "11:38",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 477.199,
      "end": 479.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and become as a little child,",
      "verse": "11:38",
      "lineIndex": 156
    },
    {
      "start": 479.515,
      "end": 482.626,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or ye can in nowise inherit the kingdom of God.",
      "verse": "11:38",
      "lineIndex": 157
    },
    {
      "start": 483.306,
      "end": 485.628,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Verily, verily, I say unto you",
      "verse": "11:39",
      "lineIndex": 158
    },
    {
      "start": 485.808,
      "end": 487.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that this is my doctrine,",
      "verse": "11:39",
      "lineIndex": 159
    },
    {
      "start": 487.66,
      "end": 490.818,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and whoso buildeth upon this buildeth upon my rock,",
      "verse": "11:39",
      "lineIndex": 160
    },
    {
      "start": 490.998,
      "end": 493.831,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the gates of hell shall not prevail against them.",
      "verse": "11:39",
      "lineIndex": 161
    },
    {
      "start": 494.511,
      "end": 497.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whoso shall declare more or less than this,",
      "verse": "11:40",
      "lineIndex": 162
    },
    {
      "start": 497.756,
      "end": 499.985,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and establish it for my doctrine,",
      "verse": "11:40",
      "lineIndex": 163
    },
    {
      "start": 500.165,
      "end": 503.787,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the same cometh of evil, and is not built upon my rock;",
      "verse": "11:40",
      "lineIndex": 164
    },
    {
      "start": 503.967,
      "end": 506.428,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but he buildeth upon a sandy foundation,",
      "verse": "11:40",
      "lineIndex": 165
    },
    {
      "start": 506.608,
      "end": 509.859,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the gates of hell stand open to receive such",
      "verse": "11:40",
      "lineIndex": 166
    },
    {
      "start": 510.039,
      "end": 513.197,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "when the floods come and the winds beat upon them.",
      "verse": "11:40",
      "lineIndex": 167
    },
    {
      "start": 513.877,
      "end": 516.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, go forth unto this people,",
      "verse": "11:41",
      "lineIndex": 168
    },
    {
      "start": 516.472,
      "end": 521.673,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and declare the words which I have spoken, unto the ends of the earth.",
      "verse": "11:41",
      "lineIndex": 169
    }
  ]
}